OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening leading into a mild night.
OL,7,FBecoming cloudier from the west during
OL,8,Fthe early hours, ahead of occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy rain spreading southeast by dawn.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FEarly cloud and rain clearing
OL,12,Fto a brighter, fresher-feeling day,
OL,13,Fwith some warm sunny spells and a
OL,14,Fnorthwesterly wind. Cloudier at times
OL,15,Fin the west, with isolated showers
OL,16,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
